 150: // The ONE place a court office changes hands. It exists because who holds an
 151: // office is currently TWO independent facts that agree only by luck:
 152: //
 153: //   - `characters.court_category`, the plain nullable enum that actually gates
 154: //     behaviour today (office-actions.js's auth check, office-tab.js's
 155: //     isOwnOffice, city-tab.js, admin/city-views.js's court list), and
 156: //   - `office_seats.holder_id`, the seat-identity field oxp.1 introduced and
 157: //     oxp.2's and oxp.11's client code depend on to work out WHICH seat's
 158: //     purchase state to show.
