 174: // WHY resolveOfficeSeat() IS NOT USED HERE, and must not be reintroduced by a
 175: // later tidy-up (oxp.5 Finding 2, both reasons independently disqualifying):
 176: //
 177: //   1. It 400s any seat whose office has no OFFICE_DATA entry. That is
 178: //      Administrator, until oxp.8 authors its content — and the Administrator
 179: //      seat is real, filled (Ivana Horvat, since Game 5) and must be
 180: //      handoverable. That refusal is CORRECT for a purchase route, which
 181: //      cannot validate a merit or a rank without rules, and wrong for a
